NOTE ON EMOJI ARTWORK

This project contains no emoji artwork and ships no prebuilt atlas. The
generator downloads glyphs from whichever source you configure at build time.

Apple Color Emoji is a trademark of Apple Inc. and its artwork is not licensed
for redistribution by third parties. If you use --source apple, bundling the
resulting atlas inside a distributed application is your decision and your
responsibility.

Noto Color Emoji is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and is
explicitly redistributable. Use --source noto if you want a clearly safe
default.
